              "text": "démarrer — \"to start up (a car, an engine); to get going\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ce matin, la vieille voiture ne démarre pas. This morning the old car will not start."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also for projects: le travail démarre lundi."
            }
